  "default_unit_id": 1,
  "notes": "CRITICAL: Micro800 uses symbolic tag mapping for Modbus via Connected Components Workbench (CCW). There are NO fixed addresses - tags must be mapped to Modbus addresses in CCW. Micro810 does NOT support Modbus TCP. Micro820 has built-in Ethernet with Modbus TCP server.",
  "source": "Rockwell Publication 2080-UM002, Connected Components Workbench Help",
